[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153msessionStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mLives until the tab closes. Covers cross-form reads within a session; no shared-machine residue. Swappable later.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m localStorage
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restarts for cross-visit continuity. Needs an explicit clear-on-logout path this app lacks today.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m In-memory only
     [38;5;246mA variable in the identity module; cleared on reload. Leaks nothing, but does not survive a refresh.[39m
